<title>USA: Avalon, N.J., won by Prudential Securities.</title>
<headline>Avalon, N.J., won by Prudential Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $11.400 million of Avalon, N.J., various general obligation bonds, with a lowest rate of 5.25, highest price of 100.007.</p>
</text>
